flowchart LR
  P[parameters.yaml] --> Init[Agent.__init__\n(load hyperparams to self.*)]
  Init --> AgentObj[Agent instance]
  AgentObj --> Run[run(is_training, render)]
  Run --> Env[Gym Env init (FlappyBird-v0)]
  Run --> Policy[DQN policy_dqn]
  Run -->|if training| Replay[ReplayMemory]
  Run -->|if training| Target[target_dqn (copy of policy_dqn)]
  Run --> EpisodeLoop[Episode loop]

  EpisodeLoop --> State[state (env.reset / tensor)]
  State --> ActionSel{Action selection}
  ActionSel -->|explore (rand < eps)| RandA[env.action_space.sample()]
  ActionSel -->|exploit| NetA[policy_dqn(state) -> argmax]
  RandA --> EnvStep[env.step(action)]
  NetA --> EnvStep
  EnvStep --> Next[next_state, reward, done]
  Next --> ToTensor[next_state/reward -> tensors]
  ToTensor -->|if training| Append[Replay.append((s,a,r,s',done))]
  Append --> MemoryLenCheck{len(memory) > minibatch_size}
  MemoryLenCheck -->|yes| Sample[mini_batch = memory.sample(minibatch_size)]
  Sample --> Optimize[optimize(mini_batch, policy_dqn, target_dqn)]

  Optimize -->|compute target using| Target
  Optimize -->|compute current using| Policy
  Optimize -->|backprop -> update| Policy

  EpisodeLoop -->|periodic| Sync[target_dqn <- policy_dqn (every network_sync_rate)]
  EpisodeLoop -->|if new best| Save[torch.save(policy_dqn.state_dict())]

  subgraph CLI
    Main[__main__ argparser] --> Create[Agent(param_set)]
    Create -->|--train| RunTrain[run(is_training=True)]
    Create -->|--eval| RunEval[run(is_training=False, render=True)]
  end

  style P fill:#f9f,stroke:#333,stroke-width:1px
  style Policy fill:#bbf
  style Target fill:#bbf
  style Replay fill:#ffd
  style Optimize fill:#fdd
  style Env fill:#dfd
  style CLI fill:#eee
